  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the implementation of the Health Financing Progress  Matrix  (HFPM) in South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">.The Health Financing Progress Matrix (HFPM)  developed as standardized qualitative assessment of a country&#x2019;s health financing system, is meant to provide more real-time information to policy makers, building on the quantitative approaches such as the System of Health Accounts and Financial Risk Protection monitoring which contribute to the HFPM background indicators.</narrative>
  </description>
